    LLM: 'Game: Tute. Logic: See rules.objective and rules.gameplay.',
    Player: "Tute is one of Spain's most popular card games, played with a 40-card Spanish deck. Named from Italian 'tutti'. Features A-3-K ranking, strict follow-suit/trump rules, and 'Cantes' (declaring K+Kt of same suit for bonus). Collecting all 4 Kings or 4 Knights = instant Tute win. 10 bonus for last trick.",
    objective: 'Score 101+ points. Or declare Tute (4 Kings or 4 Knights).',
    gameplay: 'Follow suit. Must play higher if possible. Must trump if void in suit. Cantes: K+Kt of trump = 40 pts. K+Kt of other suit = 20 pts. Cantes only after winning first trick. Last trick = 10 bonus. 7 of trumps can swap with face-up trump card.',
